    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "81 Dromroe Avenue,Woodhaven, Castletroy,Limerick, V94 Y71H \r\nExcellent opportunity to acquire a 3bed end of terrace in good condition. This spacious residence has just come to the market, the property needs to be refreshed and requires redecoration and new carpets to make the residence turn key this can be achieved with  with little outlay. \r\nSituated in Castletroy in the heart of one of the fastest growing towns in Limerick Woodhaven would be considered one of Castletroys most sought after residential addresses\r\n. \r\nThe property features gas fired central heating, PVC windows and doors, open heart fire place, private off-street parking and fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances. \r\nThe property comprises of a spacious sitting room, welcoming entrance hallway, open plan kitchen/dining area, downstairs guest toilet   three 1st floor generous bedrooms with one ensuite and  main bathroom. \r\nThis property has an impressive rear garden with its own side access, garden shed and   private parking area to the front. \r\nConveniently located just off the main Dublin to Limerick Road the residence is close to Schools, University, shops, restaurants, pubs, and other recreational activities that Castletroy and Limerick city has to offer, which makes this   property perfect for either residing or investment purposes. Ver Rating C\r\nViewings strictly by appointment only with Joint agents BOC Properties and Synergy Property Management Ltd"
      },
      {
